      "lemmas": [
        "spóźniony"
      ],
      "explain": "You already know the noun opóźnienie (a delay). spóźniony is the adjective you put on the thing that is running late, and it agrees like every other adjective."
    },
    {
      "en": "Mum is late.",
      "pl": "Mama jest spóźniona.",
      "accepts": [
        "Mama jest spóźniona.",
