        "byc_present",
        "byc_adj",
        "zgoda"
      ],
      "lemmas": [
        "spóźniona"
      ],
      "explain": "mama is feminine, so the adjective takes -a: spóźniona. A man says jestem spóźniony, a woman jestem spóźniona."
    },
    {
      "en": "I'm late, I'm going by car. (m)",
